  "explanation": {
    "md_es": [
      "**Pregunta en pasado con Wh-:** palabra interrogativa + **did** + sujeto + **verbo base**.",
      "",
      "| Pregunta | Respuesta típica |",
      "|---|---|",
      "| **Where** did you go? | To Italy. |",
      "| **Who** did you go with? | With my sister. |",
      "| **How** did you travel? | By train. / We flew. |",
      "| **How long** did you stay? | Ten days. |",
      "| **When** did you arrive? | On Monday. |",
      "| **What** did you do? | We visited museums. |",
      "| **Why** did you choose Rome? | Because I love history. |",
      "",
      "Recuerda: después de **did** el verbo va en base (*go*, no *went*).",
      "",
      "**Ojo:** si el interrogativo es el sujeto, no se usa did: *Who went with you?* (¿quién fue contigo?).",
      "",
      "Pronunciación: en la pregunta, la voz baja al final: *Where did you go? ↘*"
    ],
    "common_mistakes_es": [
      {
        "wrong": "Where you went?",
        "right": "Where did you go?",
        "note": "Falta did."
      },
      {
        "wrong": "What did you ate?",
        "right": "What did you eat?",
        "note": "Después de did el verbo va en base."
      }
    ],
    "false_friends": []
  },
